`bt_netdev_register()` calls `bt_add_services()` after `bt_initialize()` when `CONFIG_WIRELESS_BLUETOOTH_HOST` is enabled:

`/home/mi/vela_competition/contest/nuttx/wireless/bluetooth/bt_netdev.c:1279-1281`.

The built-in implementation is:

`/home/mi/vela_competition/contest/nuttx/wireless/bluetooth/bt_services.c:230-242`

```c
