err = bt_start_advertising(BT_LE_ADV_IND, g_ad, g_sd);
```

The built-in database contains the GAP service, device-name characteristic/value, and appearance characteristic/value:

`/home/mi/vela_competition/contest/nuttx/wireless/bluetooth/bt_services.c:61-65` and `124-133`.

The default advertising data is:

`/home/mi/vela_competition/contest/nuttx/wireless/bluetooth/bt_services.c:135-164`

